    "body": "Yes, I'm aware that the default for git is `master` (sorry it wasn't clear from the OP), but if I change the default (similarly to your example) it would be nice if it's reflected in Starship.\r\n\r\nStarship hardcodes the default to `\"master\"` here: https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/4788092423fd42387b49f60d2a2d89db0deb6bab/src/context.rs#L319 . ",
